	(text "Coplanar differential USB pairs (JLCPCB, 2 Layers JLC0216)\n   - Dieletric=4.5\n   - H=1.465\n   - eps=0.02\n\nJLCPCB coplanar     (W=0.32mm, S=0.15mm, g=0.2mm)\nuSimmics coplanar   (W=0.34mm, S=0.15mm, g=0.2mm) --> Zodd=44.91ohms\n\nUSB HS rise time is close to 5mm and this board is using FS is close to 1 meter !\nSo via stitching is not relevant."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.971 100.584 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
